{"repositoryId":560367066,"availability":"available","full":"tom-draper/persona","name":"persona","description":"Probabilistic character profile generation using real-world demographic data.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":11,"forks":1,"created":"2022-11-01T10:41:04Z","updated":"2026-10-02T10:35:16Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://persona-api.vercel.app/v1","topics":["api","character-creation","character-generator","data-api","data-generation","dataset","demographic","demographics","demographics-data","fastapi","generator","persona","probabilistic-models","profile","profile-builder","random-generation","rest-api","sample","story-creation","survey"],"demo":"https://persona-api.vercel.app/v1","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.363Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.363Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.363Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:22.363Z","stars":11,"forks":1}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Make your characters more representative and realistic.","A REST API and CLI tool for probabilistically generating random character profiles from a given input location using real-world demographic data. Generating a new persona rolls the dice on features such as age, sex, sexuality, ethnicity, language and religion. This project was born out of a lack of tools for building representative and realistic characters for stories."],"features":["Limit the response to specific features using the features query parameter.","Pass a seed integer to get the same persona(s) back every time.","A partial path fixes the outer levels and fills in the rest at random — e.g. /v1/unitedkingdom/england/ always picks England, then randomly London or the rest of England.","For an unambiguous, machine-readable list of every location, including nested ones, use /v1/location-paths/. It returns canonical paths such as unitedstatesofamerica/georgia; /v1